    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Quand la partie supérieure de son corps, couverte de glace, frissonne, il produit de l’électricité. Il éprouve de grandes difficultés à marcher.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "The shaking of its freezing upper half is what generates its electricity. It has a hard time walking around.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "氷漬けの　上半身が 震えると　電気が　つくられる。 歩くことが　非常に　苦手。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Autrefois, il vivait en bord de mer et conservait sa nourriture dans la glace de son corps, mais il s’est éteint, car il avait du mal à se déplacer.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This Pokémon lived on prehistoric seashores and was able to preserve food with the ice on its body. It went extinct because it moved so slowly.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "古代の　海辺で　暮らし　餌を 体の　氷で　保存できたが 動きが　鈍いため　絶滅した。",
        "language": {
